  "note": ["The neon environment (ps-bop.3.7: a city at night; very dark and cool): the arena's area plan in POLYGON CyberCity's and SciFi City's streets: lit low-rise blocks, shacks, power units, parked vehicles and street poles for the forest, street furniture, crates, bins, vending machines and hover lights for the edge bands, glowing manholes, puddles and litter on a near-black wet street. A hologram cherry tree for the glowing tree, a ring of street-light pylons, a night market for the graveyard, shopfront walls for the ruin walls and the courtyard (a neon dragon over its north wall), a food truck at the opening. A dim cool key on the set, a neutral key on the horde, magenta and cyan emissives and pools everywhere, violet fog and a cool grade. Its palette and findings: demo3d/evidence/look/env-neon/README.md. Format: arena-layout.json's note, Environments."],
